{"id":"d361a187ee93c869","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-local-list-decoder.md","title":"带统一建议索引的局部列表译码器","display":"df-local-list-decoder — 带统一建议索引的局部列表译码器","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-local-list-decoder","aliases":["28-df-local-list-decoder"],"display":"df-local-list-decoder — 带统一建议索引的局部列表译码器","depends_on":["[[28-df-local-decoder]]","[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 19.25","source_printed_pages":"394","source_pdf_pages":"420","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-local-list-decoder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-local-list-decoder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-list-decoder — 带统一建议索引的局部列表译码器"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a58fab71e26cf742\" href=\"?note=a58fab71e26cf742\" title=\"28-df-local-decoder\">28-df-local-decoder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 19.25"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"394"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"420"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=(E_m)_{m\\ge1}\">\\(E=(E_m)_{m\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_m:\\{0,1\\}^{n(m)}\\to\\{0,1\\}^m\">\\(E_m:\\{0,1\\}^{n(m)}\\to\\{0,1\\}^m\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}\">\\(D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a\\rangle\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a58fab71e26cf742\" href=\"?note=a58fab71e26cf742\" title=\"28-df-local-decoder\">28-df-local-decoder</a> 的单比特串记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o_D^y\">\\(o_D^y\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_D^y\">\\(\\tau_D^y\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a58fab71e26cf742\" href=\"?note=a58fab71e26cf742\" title=\"28-df-local-decoder\">28-df-local-decoder</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^y(m,i,j;r)\">\\(D^y(m,i,j;r)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_D^y(m,i,j;r)\">\\(T_D^y(m,i,j;r)\\)</span> 由下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in[0,1)\">\\(\\rho\\in[0,1)\\)</span> 是本谓词的固定可处理半径，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon=1-\\rho&gt;0\">\\(\\epsilon=1-\\rho&gt;0\\)</span>。算法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 可专门化该固定参数；运行时输入只有以标准二进制编码的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,i,j\">\\(m,i,j\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\epsilon\">\\(\\rho,\\epsilon\\)</span> 不作为额外机器输入。距离见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\">\\(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\)</span>；三参数编码以下采用当前的正整数长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{in}_3(m,i,j)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(\\operatorname{bin}(m),\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(\\operatorname{bin}(i),\\operatorname{bin}(j))),\\qquad D^y(m,i,j;r)\\coloneqq o_D^y(\\operatorname{in}_3(m,i,j);r),\\qquad T_D^y(m,i,j;r)\\coloneqq\\tau_D^y(\\operatorname{in}_3(m,i,j);r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{in}_3(m,i,j)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(\\operatorname{bin}(m),\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(\\operatorname{bin}(i),\\operatorname{bin}(j))),\\qquad D^y(m,i,j;r)\\coloneqq o_D^y(\\operatorname{in}_3(m,i,j);r),\\qquad T_D^y(m,i,j;r)\\coloneqq\\tau_D^y(\\operatorname{in}_3(m,i,j);r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{LocalListDecoder}(D,E;\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}\\land\\exists c,a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\quad[&amp;\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\;\\forall i\\in[\\lceil c(n(m)/\\epsilon+1)^a\\rceil]\\;\\forall j\\in[n(m)]\\;\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\;T_D^y(m,i,j;r)\\le c(\\epsilon^{-1}\\lceil\\log_2(m+2)\\rceil+1)^b\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n(m)}\\;\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\;(\\Delta_m^{\\{0,1\\}}(E_m(x),y)\\le\\rho\\Rightarrow\\exists i_0\\in[\\lceil c(n(m)/\\epsilon+1)^a\\rceil]\\;\\forall j\\in[n(m)]\\;\\nu\\{r:D^y(m,i_0,j;r)=\\langle x_j\\rangle\\}\\ge2/3)].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{LocalListDecoder}(D,E;\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}\\land\\exists c,a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\quad[&amp;\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\;\\forall i\\in[\\lceil c(n(m)/\\epsilon+1)^a\\rceil]\\;\\forall j\\in[n(m)]\\;\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\;T_D^y(m,i,j;r)\\le c(\\epsilon^{-1}\\lceil\\log_2(m+2)\\rceil+1)^b\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n(m)}\\;\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\;(\\Delta_m^{\\{0,1\\}}(E_m(x),y)\\le\\rho\\Rightarrow\\exists i_0\\in[\\lceil c(n(m)/\\epsilon+1)^a\\rceil]\\;\\forall j\\in[n(m)]\\;\\nu\\{r:D^y(m,i_0,j;r)=\\langle x_j\\rangle\\}\\ge2/3)].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>i₀ 在所有坐标 j 之前量化，故同一索引服务整个消息。用统一码族、统一算法及跨m一致的常数把原书渐近复杂度写入正式条件；常数可以依赖当前固定半径ρ。原文 j∈[m] 与消息长度不合，纠正为 [n(m)]。本条允许全部固定实半径ρ∈[0,1)，包括二元码有意义的ρ=1/4；ε=1−ρ仅作为数学资源界中的正实常数，算法无需读取实数编码。若研究同一算法随精度变化的统一性，应另给可编码精度域和跨参数一致的常数，不能由此固定参数谓词推出。所有实际输入读取计入T。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 19.25；印刷页 394；PDF 页 420。</p>\n<p>R7复核：Definition 19.25（PDF420–421）针对固定ρ=1−ε。旧式要求同一二元码族对全部t≥1均有poly(n t)建议索引，是过强量词：t=2时对全部中心y双计数，每个码字在半径m/2内覆盖至少一半中心，故某y邻近至少2^{n(m)−1}条消息；同一索引在每坐标以≥2/3概率译码，不能同时服务两条在某坐标不同的消息。对无界n(m)，这与poly(n(m))索引数矛盾。本次全目录搜索未发现旧二参数谓词的实际公式调用，只有本文件及MOC/历史报告导航；不修改历史报告。最终接口采用任意固定ρ，而不采用倒整数精度：倒整数只给ρ=0或ρ≥1/2，无法表达例如ρ=1/4的二元译码条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-local-decoder","status":"resolved","id":"a58fab71e26cf742","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-local-decoder]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-local-decoder","status":"resolved","id":"a58fab71e26cf742","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$E=(E_m)_{m\\ge1}$，$E_m:\\{0,1\\}^{n(m)}\\to\\{0,1\\}^m$。$D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}$，$\\langle a\\rangle$ 沿用 [[28-df-local-decoder]] 的单比特串记号；$o_D^y$、$\\tau_D^y$、$\\operatorname{bin}$、$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$、$\\nu$ 采用 [[28-df-local-decoder]]；$D^y(m,i,j;r)$、$T_D^y(m,i,j;r)$ 由下式定义，$r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}$；$\\rho\\in[0,1)$ 是本谓词的固定可处理半径，$\\epsilon=1-\\rho>0$。算法 $D$ 可专门化该固定参数；运行时输入只有以标准二进制编码的 $m,i,j$，$\\rho,\\epsilon$ 不作为额外机器输入。距离见 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-local-decoder","status":"resolved","id":"a58fab71e26cf742","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$E=(E_m)_{m\\ge1}$，$E_m:\\{0,1\\}^{n(m)}\\to\\{0,1\\}^m$。$D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}$，$\\langle a\\rangle$ 沿用 [[28-df-local-decoder]] 的单比特串记号；$o_D^y$、$\\tau_D^y$、$\\operatorname{bin}$、$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$、$\\nu$ 采用 [[28-df-local-decoder]]；$D^y(m,i,j;r)$、$T_D^y(m,i,j;r)$ 由下式定义，$r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}$；$\\rho\\in[0,1)$ 是本谓词的固定可处理半径，$\\epsilon=1-\\rho>0$。算法 $D$ 可专门化该固定参数；运行时输入只有以标准二进制编码的 $m,i,j$，$\\rho,\\epsilon$ 不作为额外机器输入。距离见 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$E=(E_m)_{m\\ge1}$，$E_m:\\{0,1\\}^{n(m)}\\to\\{0,1\\}^m$。$D\\in\\mathsf{LDM}$，$\\